# Author request: disable ALL textual diffs to reduce Arena UI overhead.
# Applies to current and future files, including individual manuscript chapters.
# Files remain tracked and readable; no content or history is removed.
# Read full files normally. For an explicit local comparison of a TEXT file:
#   git diff --text <base> <head> -- <path>
# Do not force --text over the whole repository (it includes PDF/PNG/ZIP).
# Arena may still show a changed-file list or use its own diff/cache behavior.
# To restore normal textual diffs, remove the following rule in a normal commit.
* -diff

